        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eddie \"The Eagle\" Edwards, Michael Edwards, Taron Egerton, Dexter Fletcher\n- Works: Eddie the Eagle\n- Events: 1988 Winter Olympics, Olympic ski jumping\n- Places: Great Britain\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Edwards was born on 5 December 1963 and is best known as \"Eddie the Eagle.\"\n- In 1988, Michael Edwards became the first competitor since 1929 to represent Great Britain in Olympic ski jumping.\n- In 1988, Michael Edwards finished last in the 70 m and 90 m Olympic ski jumping events.\n- Eddie the Eagle is a 2016 biographical sports comedy-drama film directed by Dexter Fletcher.\n- In Eddie the Eagle, Taron Egerton stars as Eddie Edwards.",
